{"id":"DRKS00035815","src":"drks","title":"Acute Management and Outcomes after ischemic STroke in patients with known Atrial Fibrillation","official":"","summary":"Ziel des MOST-AF-Registers ist es, die klinischen Charakteristika von Patienten mit akutem ischämischem Schlaganfall und bekannten Vorhofflimmern zu beschreiben, die klinische Praxis der Akutbehandlung dieser Patienten auf deutschen Stroke Units zu dokumentieren, und Routinedaten zu klinischen Verläufen und funktionellem Outcome zu erheben.","conditions":["Cerebral infarction"],"interventions":[{"type":"ARM","name":"Acute stroke patients with known atrial fibrillation receive standard care. Data on acute management and past medical history is extracted from routine clinical notes. Data on 90-day outcomes is collected via a follow-up interview."}],"criteria":"Inclusion criteria:\nClinical diagnosis of acute ischemic stroke\r\nStroke symptom onset within 24 hours prior to presentation\r\nKnown diagnosis of atrial fibrillation\r\nTreatment on a certified German Stroke Unit or Neuro-Intensive Care Unit\nExclusion criteria:\nFirst diagnosis of atrial fibrillation in-hospital\r\nParticipation in a randomized acute stroke trial with concealed treatment allocation","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":null,"start":"2025-02-01","pcd":"2028-01-31","upd":"2025-12-12","sponsor":"Universitätsklinikum Hamburg-Eppendorf","areas":["other"],"central":["Dr. Dr. Eckhard Schlemm · Universitätsklinikum Hamburg-Eppendorf · +4915222898447 · e.schlemm@uke.de"],"sites":[{"f":"Universitätsklinikum Hamburg-Eppendorf","city":"Hamburg","zip":"","s":"R","pr":"","c":"","lat":53.5507,"lon":9.993},{"f":"Universitätsklinikum Leipzig","city":"Leipzig","zip":"","s":"R","pr":"","c":"","lat":51.3396,"lon":12.3713},{"f":"Charité Berlin","city":"Berlin","zip":"","s":"R","pr":"","c":"","lat":52.5244,"lon":13.4105},{"f":"Klinikum Lüneburg","city":"Lüneburg","zip":"","s":